      "Nevada statutes do not require a residential landlord to disclose mold, and they set no separate mold-remediation duty. Mold is handled through your general duty to keep the unit habitable and to comply with housing and health codes. In a county with a district board of health, the board can also regulate health hazards in rental units.",
