      "Wyoming statutes do not address tenant-installed security cameras, video doorbells or similar devices. The lease's alteration and installation terms govern -- in this library, the Alterations section, which requires your written consent before a tenant adds or changes a fixture. Wyoming's recording and surveillance laws, and any homeowners-association rules, were not reviewed and may apply to what a camera records rather than to its installation.",
