      "In Iowa, intentionally misrepresenting an animal as a service animal or service animal in training, to obtain any right or privilege under state or federal law, is a simple misdemeanor. Because the offense turns on obtaining any legal right, it can reach a request for housing. An online registration, ID card, patch or certificate does not by itself establish a disability or a need for the animal; report suspected misrepresentation rather than deciding a request on suspicion alone.",
