      "You may refuse cash, but if you accept cash you must give a receipt. For any other payment, give a written receipt when the tenant asks. You must accept a personal check (unless one bounced or hit a closed account in the past nine months), a cashier's check or a money order, must let the tenant pay by mail unless you have an accessible on-site payment location, and may not require electronic payment only.",
