    bodyText:
      "A tenant who asks for a written record of a payment is entitled to one as a condition of making the payment: a receipt, account statement or other acknowledgment showing the amount, the date and information identifying you or the property. If the tenant pays by mail, deposit or another method not in person and asks for the record, you must provide it within a reasonable time.",
