      "Before taking a screening charge you must give the applicant written notice of the charge, the rent and the deposits you will require, and any renter's insurance requirement, among other items. Before taking a deposit to secure a rental agreement you must give a written statement of the rent, the fees you will charge and the deposits. Every fee you charge must be described in the written rental agreement. Oregon has no statute requiring an all-in rent figure in advertisements or a fee box on the first page of the lease.",
