    ruleTypes: ["RECOMMENDED"],
    verificationStatus: "VERIFIED",
    topicKey: "security-deposit-cap",
    bodyText:
      "West Virginia does not limit how much you can charge as a security deposit. A refundable pet deposit, and a pet fee or application fee that the tenant has not expressly agreed in writing is nonrefundable, is part of the security deposit and is returned under the deposit rules. Prepaid rent is not a security deposit. You may not charge any deposit or fee for an assistance animal.",
